      "observation": "Dimensional splitting extends one-dimensional high-resolution methods to more dimensions by successive coordinate-direction problems. The source describes this as the simplest extension under the stated grid condition."
    },
    {
      "location": "Raw PDF page 28; printed page 6; Section 1.3, second paragraph",
